From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Sargison <sargo@sargo.cc>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:10:26 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 84/97] Plutonium: ext_data_control_v1, the clipboard for
 clipboard managers

Clipboard managers and wl-copy and wl-paste read and set the clipboard
without focus, and hear of every change. A device offers the clipboard
when made and on each change, as DataDevice offers it to a focused app;
set_selection reads the source into the clipboard as wl_data_device's
does (Seat::SetSelectionFromDataControl(), the focus check left out),
and a null source clears it. Exo has no primary selection: a source
given to set_primary_selection is cancelled, so wl-copy --primary
doesn't wait for ever. Any client may use it: whatever runs as the user
could read and set the clipboard some other way.
